# Keep immutable forward-test baselines and their validation rows:
# auditable records of what a model claimed on a date. The research
# baselines are the record Score v3 is judged against, so they are tracked
# in the same way; the CSV only, since the JSON repeats it at 4x the size.
!data/exports/moonshot_forward_baseline_*.csv
!data/exports/moonshot_validation_*.csv
!data/exports/research_forward_baseline_*.csv
